<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Full & Final Settlement</title>
<style>
@page { size:A4; margin:12mm; }
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
body { margin:0; background:#fff; color:#000; font:12px Arial, sans-serif; line-height:1.55; }
.header { width:100%; border-bottom:2px solid #000; padding-bottom:18px; margin-bottom:22px; }
.logo { width:235px; height:auto; display:block; }
.company { text-align:right; font-size:10px; }
h1 { font-size:21px; margin:0 0 4px; letter-spacing:.5px; }
.subtitle { margin:0 0 20px; font-size:11px; }
.details,.amounts { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:20px; }
.details td { width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding:5px 12px 5px 0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.label { font-weight:bold; }
.amounts th,.amounts td { border:1px solid #aaa; padding:9px 12px; background:#fff; color:#000; }
.amounts th { text-align:left; border-bottom:2px solid #000; }
.amounts td:last-child,.amounts th:last-child { text-align:right; width:32%; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
.total td { font-weight:bold; border-top:2px solid #000; border-bottom:2px solid #000; font-size:14px; }
.authorization { margin-top:26px; break-inside:avoid; }
.signature { width:145px; height:65px; object-fit:contain; display:block; margin-bottom:4px; }
.footer { border-top:1px solid #aaa; margin-top:24px; padding-top:10px; font-size:10px; }
</style></head><body>
<table class="header"><tr><td><img src="<%= logo %>" class="logo" alt="Viral Ads Media"></td><td class="company"><strong>VIRAL ADS MEDIA</strong><br><%= companyAddress %></td></tr></table>
<h1>FULL &amp; FINAL SETTLEMENT</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Date of issue: <%= currentDate %> &nbsp; | &nbsp; Status: <%= status %></p>
<table class="details"><tr><td><span class="label">Employee name:</span> <%= employeeName %><br><span class="label">Employee ID:</span> <%= employeeId %><br><span class="label">Designation:</span> <%= designation %><br><span class="label">Email:</span> <%= email %><br><span class="label">Phone:</span> <%= phone %></td><td><span class="label">Joining date:</span> <%= dateOfJoining %><br><span class="label">Last working day:</span> <%= lastWorkingDay %><br><span class="label">Bank account:</span> <%= bankAccount %><br><span class="label">IFSC:</span> <%= ifsc %><br><span class="label">Address:</span> <%= address %></td></tr></table>
<table class="amounts"><thead><tr><th>Particulars</th><th>Amount (INR)</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Unpaid salary</td><td><%= pendingSalary %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Leave encashment</td><td><%= leaveEncashment %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Bonus / performance incentive</td><td><%= incentive %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Gratuity</td><td><%= gratuity %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Notice recovery</td><td>− <%= noticeRecovery %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Other deductions / tax</td><td>− <%= deductions %></td></tr>
<tr class="total"><td>NET SETTLEMENT AMOUNT</td><td>₹ <%= totalPayable %></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>This statement sets out the final employment dues and deductions. A negative net amount represents a recovery due. Payment confirmation is provided separately by payroll.</p>
<div class="authorization"><img class="signature" src="<%= hrSignature %>" alt="HR Signature"><strong>Authorized Signatory</strong><br>HR &amp; Accounts Department<br>For Viral Ads Media</div>
<div class="footer">Viral Ads Media &nbsp; | &nbsp; Full &amp; Final Settlement Statement</div>
</body></html>
